  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Zooplankton Database",
  "description": "Dataset which holds most of the zooplankton sampling station data in the NE Pacific Ocean taken by the Institute of Ocean Sciences and Pacific Biological Station from about 1983 to present. May be data collected for projects such as JGOFS, GLOBEC, La Perouse, SUPER, Line P, Station P, Haida Eddy, euphausid stock assessment, Bowie Seamount.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Supports scientific and environmental research.\n\nSupplemental information: Physical samples exist for this dataset. Custom software is available for use with this dataset.",
